Thank you so much Canned_Dinosaur. That worked amazingly well and is much simpler than what I was trying to do.
As for what I meant about the solution only working on maps the exact size of the screen, my coordinates would be off due to how I was calculating them the top left of the screen would always be 0,0 no mater where the player was on the map.
This answers my question.
